      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "We proved the idea locally. Now let's make it production-ready. The best part is I don't have to rebuild anything. I'm still working with the same agent. I'm just giving it the production services it needs.",
      "demo_actions": "Stay in the same session with the Part 1 canvas still visible. Frame this as the move from local proof of concept to production readiness.",
