        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~15s",
      "narrative": "But the model was never the interesting part. The real value comes from grounding the agent in Caldova's knowledge. For this one, I connect it to our contracts in Foundry IQ. Now, instead of guessing negotiated rates, it validates against the actual agreement.",
      "demo_actions": "Point at the Tools tile and call out Foundry IQ with the contracts knowledge base.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "And because it's an extensible platform, I choose the model, the knowledge, and where the agent runs.",
      "demo_actions": "Click the Connection tab and show build_agent(), the model choice, the Foundry endpoint, and FoundryIQ(knowledge_base='contracts-kb').",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
