        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "This time it catches the incorrect unit rate, identifies the unauthorized packaging charge, and cites the exact contract language behind each finding. That's the difference between an answer and an auditable answer.",
      "demo_actions": "After the answer returns, click the Trace tab and show the live knowledge_base_retrieve call with the highlighted contract clauses behind each finding.",
