      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Here's Caldova Waypoint, the invoice review application the finance team uses every day. Every invoice analyzed by the agent shows up here with a recommendation, supporting evidence, confidence score, and the contract or policy behind the decision.",
      "demo_actions": "Transition to the Waypoint app visual and orient the viewer to the invoice review UI.",
