        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Finance can filter by escalation, review recoverable overpayments, and prioritize the items that need action first. But people don't always start in the application. Sometimes they're already collaborating in Teams, discussing an invoice or asking a question. Because this is the same hosted agent, I can publish it into Microsoft Teams as well.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the Waypoint filters and queue views, then transition toward the Teams visual to set up the same agent in a collaboration surface.",
