        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "So whether finance is working in Waypoint or asking a question in Teams, they get the same grounded agent, the same business knowledge, and the same auditable reasoning. So what started as a local proof of concept is now a production agent: grounded in Caldova's data, hosted in Foundry, and available where the team already works.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the Teams answer, then pause on a closing visual that pairs Waypoint and Teams.",
